If criteria is not given then checklist(s) configured against the given event will be returned.
    In case criteria is provided, specific checklist(s) that fulfills given criteria will be returned.
    Criteria is open ended, but must follow this pattern.  ****
    {"event_name": "string",
     "criteria": {
                    "item1": "",
                    "item2": ""
                }
} ****
